==Russian==
===Noun===
'''господь''' (χospód’) {{m}}
:''Note: Some people prefer to capitalize this word:''''' Господь'''''. Also, some people, especially northerners, will pronounce the '''''Г''''' hard instead of as '''''Х'''. ''The [[vocative case]] is much more likely to be pronounced with a very soft '''''Х'''.

#the [[Lord]], [[God]]
#:*{{RUchar|Го́споди!}} ''([[vocative case|vocative]])'' — ''Goodness gracious!''
#:*{{RUchar|[[не|Не]] [[давать|дай]] го́споди!}} — ''God forbid!''
#:*{{RUchar|Госпо́дь [[он|его́]] [[знать|зна́ет]]!}} — ''God only knows!; Who knows?''
#:*{{RUchar|Госпо́дь [[с#Russian|с]] [[ты|тобо́й]]!}} — ''Bless you!; ''also:'' Get outta here! (incredulity)''
#:*{{RUchar|Госпо́дь [[с#Russian|с]] [[он|ним]]!}} — ''Forget him!''

